all.body:
Once you have accepted an assignment you must:

- arrive on time, fit for work and in uniform, with your SIA licence where the work is licensable;
- book on and off duty as set out in the clause on recording time;
- stay on duty for the whole assignment and not leave your post until you are properly relieved or the control room allows you to go;
- follow the assignment instructions for the site.

If you can no longer work an assignment you have accepted, tell {{sick.notify}} as soon as you can, and at least {{shift.worker_cancel}} before it starts unless you are ill or there is an emergency. Failing to attend accepted assignments without good reason may be dealt with under our disciplinary rules.
